Description: Wild OS installer
 Calamares configuration, branding and helper scripts that install Wild OS
 from the live session to disk, with full disk encryption and a recovery
 key on by default. It checks the computer first (free space, power,
 Secure Boot, and the Windows settings BitLocker and Fast Startup), and
 leaves the account, Wi-Fi and region to the first start (wildos-setup).
 Includes the WildOS.Installer QML module its pages share.
